 "remarks": "Located on the brim of vibrant downtown Stamford and in the heart of the popular Fairgate community, this newer townhome is so private + accommodating! Inside you'll find a designer kitchen with cool new granite countertops, opening to the large window-lined living-dining area featuring new laminate flooring + fresh paint. Upstairs you'll find 2 generous bedrooms, including a primary bedroom with full bath and private in-unit washer/dryer. This townhome is tucked into the Fairgate community and features treetop views! Enjoy well maintained grounds with sidewalks, professional landscaping, snow removal, on-site management + 24-hour security. Residents enjoy a meticulously maintained, pet-friendly environment - and - BONUS - access to popular Fairgate organic Farm! Central A/C, economical gas heat, 5-star energy rated appliances And NO ADDITIONAL FEES, put this townhouse on your \"must see\" list! Applicants must complete the Fairgate application uploaded in supplements and credit check through Rentspree or Applyconnect only.",
